### DEVELOPMENT ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES
## Pleas use only for developing, not in production!
## How to configure it:
## 1) Create ROOT_DIRECTORY variable pointing to the root directory of the project
## 2) Please create a "development-secret.env" file based on the variables of development-secret-template.env
## 3) Set ROOT_DIRECTORY variable, development.env and development-secret.env as environment of your IDE for the backend
## 4) Create directory "documents" in the root directory of the project

